      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "港の交易商人が食い物や酒を仕入れすぎちまった。\nそいつが太っ腹でさ、このまま悪くなるくらいなら\n振る舞うから宴でも開こうぜって話になったんだ。\n宴といえば踊りだよな？　待ってるから来てくれよ！",
        "official_en": "A trader at the port overstocked on food and drink.\nHe doesn't want it to go bad, so the generous fellow\nis throwing a banquet. Can't have a banquet without\na dance, right? Come on, we're waiting!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
