      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "待ちきれなくて宴ははじめちまってたんだが、\n食い物と酒がなくなるまえに間に合って良かったぜ。\nあんた、なかなか……いや、最高にイカしてたぜ！\n今度はシラフで拝みたいね……また来てくれよ！",
        "official_en": "Apologies for starting the banquet without you,\nbut at least you made it before the food and drinks\nran out. You were a sight to see! I'll have to make\nsure I'm sober next time I see you...",
        "real_en": null
      },
